   "s": 412,
   "e": 538
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "t": "Two p.m. Arranging trucks. Too few, and bales sit in the rain. Too many, and trucks wait empty.",
   "s": 548,
   "e": 718
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "t": "Five p.m. Calling buyers. Who needs how much, and who pays on time.",
